From 20939e43d741d61af386405edee06a4c6c853a72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: marvin <marvin@local>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 23:27:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] TICKET-EP1-01 v2: decoupled dialogue,
 per-episode+profile saves, cash, debug channels

- Campusano.Dialogue: locked data shapes (SpeakerData, DialogueLine,
  DialogueChoice, DialogueNode, DialogueDatabase), DialogueController
  (events-only, timeScale ownership, input gate), ChoiceRouter, v2 bank
- Campusano.Objectives: ObjectiveManager (HUD + waypoint, not persisted)
- Campusano.Missions: validated MissionStateMachine (AdvanceOn* funnel,
  silent RestoreToStep), EpisodeController glue, TriggerVolume v2 API
- Campusano.Persistence: per-episode saves + global profile (PlayerPrefs JSON)
- Campusano.Economy: CashService
- Campusano.UI: v2 dialogue view (Section 5 mobile spec)
- IInputProvider.GameplayInputEnabled gate; PlayerInputProvider implements it
- TEMP: DebugInputProbe for headless input diagnosis (delete before ship)
